{"s":47,"v":[{"t":"Those who disbelieve and avert [people] from the way of Allāh - He will waste their deeds.","w":[["ٱلَّذِينَ","Those who","alladhīna",""],["كَفَرُوا۟","disbelieve","kafarū","",[["كَفَرُ",53],["وا۟",3]]],["وَصَدُّوا۟","and turn away","waṣaddū","",[["وَ",1],["صَدُّ",328],["وا۟",3]]],["عَن","from","ʿan",""],["سَبِيلِ","(the) way of Allah","sabīli",""],["ٱللَّهِ","(the) way of Allah","l-lahi",""],["أَضَلَّ","He will cause to be lost","aḍalla",""],["أَعْمَـٰلَهُمْ","their deeds","aʿmālahum","",[["أَعْمَـٰلَ",183],["هُمْ",3]]]]},{"t":"And those who believe and do righteous deeds and believe in what has been sent down upon Muḥammad - and it is the truth from their Lord - He will remove from them their misdeeds and amend their condition.","w":[["وَٱلَّذِينَ","And those who","wa-alladhīna","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلَّذِينَ",17]]],["ءَامَنُوا۟","believe","āmanū","",[["ءَامَنُ",30],["وا۟",3]]],["وَعَمِلُوا۟","and do","waʿamilū","",[["وَ",1],["عَمِلُ",58],["وا۟",3]]],["ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","righteous deeds","l-ṣāliḥāti","",[["ٱل",2],["صَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ",102]]],["وَءَامَنُوا۟","and believe","waāmanū","",[["وَءَ",1],["امَنُ",30],["وا۟",3]]],["بِمَا","in what","bimā","",[["بِ",10],["مَا",12]]],["نُزِّلَ","is revealed","nuzzila",""],["عَلَىٰ","to","ʿalā",""],["مُحَمَّدٍۢ","Muhammad","muḥammadin",""],["وَهُوَ","and it","wahuwa","",[["وَ",1],["هُوَ",5]]],["ٱلْحَقُّ","(is) the truth","l-ḥaqu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حَقُّ",64]]],["مِن","from","min",""],["رَّبِّهِمْ","their Lord","rabbihim","ۙ",[["رَّبِّ",24],["هِمْ",3]]],["كَفَّرَ","He will remove","kaffara",""],["عَنْهُمْ","from them","ʿanhum","",[["عَنْ",34],["هُمْ",3]]],["سَيِّـَٔاتِهِمْ","their misdeeds","sayyiātihim","",[["سَيِّـَٔاتِ",211],["هِمْ",3]]],["وَأَصْلَحَ","and improve","wa-aṣlaḥa","",[["وَ",1],["أَصْلَحَ",393]]],["بَالَهُمْ","their condition","bālahum","",[["بَالَ",1488],["هُمْ",3]]]]},{"t":"That is because those who disbelieve follow falsehood, and those who believe follow the truth from their Lord. Thus does Allāh present to the people their comparisons.","w":[["ذَٰلِكَ","That","dhālika","",[["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كَ",0]]],["بِأَنَّ","(is) because","bi-anna","",[["بِ",10],["أَنَّ",41]]],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who","alladhīna",""],["كَفَرُوا۟","disbelieve","kafarū","",[["كَفَرُ",53],["وا۟",3]]],["ٱتَّبَعُوا۟","follow","ittabaʿū","",[["ٱتَّبَعُ",101],["وا۟",3]]],["ٱلْبَـٰطِلَ","falsehood","l-bāṭila","",[["ٱلْ",2],["بَـٰطِلَ",418]]],["وَأَنَّ","and that","wa-anna","",[["وَ",1],["أَنَّ",41]]],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who","alladhīna",""],["ءَامَنُوا۟","believe","āmanū","",[["ءَامَنُ",30],["وا۟",3]]],["ٱتَّبَعُوا۟","follow","ittabaʿū","",[["ٱتَّبَعُ",101],["وا۟",3]]],["ٱلْحَقَّ","(the) truth","l-ḥaqa","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حَقَّ",64]]],["مِن","from","min",""],["رَّبِّهِمْ","their Lord","rabbihim","ۚ",[["رَّبِّ",24],["هِمْ",3]]],["كَذَٰلِكَ","Thus","kadhālika","",[["كَ",54],["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كَ",0]]],["يَضْرِبُ","Allah presents","yaḍribu",""],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah presents","l-lahu",""],["لِلنَّاسِ","to the people","lilnnāsi","",[["لِ",8],["ل",2],["نَّاسِ",67]]],["أَمْثَـٰلَهُمْ","their similitudes","amthālahum","",[["أَمْثَـٰلَ",142],["هُمْ",3]]]]},{"t":"So when you meet those who disbelieve [in battle], strike [their] necks until, when you have inflicted slaughter upon them, then secure [their] bonds, and either [confer] favor afterwards or ransom [them] until the war lays down its burdens. That [is the command]. And if Allāh had willed, He could have taken vengeance upon them [Himself], but [He ordered armed struggle] to test some of you by means of others. And those who are killed in the cause of Allāh - never will He waste their deeds.","w":[["فَإِذَا","So when","fa-idhā","",[["فَ",7],["إِذَا",36]]],["لَقِيتُمُ","you meet","laqītumu","",[["لَقِي",662],["تُمُ",4]]],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who","alladhīna",""],["كَفَرُوا۟","disbelieve","kafarū","",[["كَفَرُ",53],["وا۟",3]]],["فَضَرْبَ","then strike","faḍarba","",[["فَ",7],["ضَرْبَ",1889]]],["ٱلرِّقَابِ","the necks","l-riqābi","",[["ٱل",2],["رِّقَابِ",894]]],["حَتَّىٰٓ","until","ḥattā",""],["إِذَآ","when","idhā",""],["أَثْخَنتُمُوهُمْ","you have subdued them","athkhantumūhum","",[["أَثْخَن",2104],["تُمُو",4],["هُمْ",3]]],["فَشُدُّوا۟","then bind firmly","fashuddū","",[["فَ",7],["شُدُّ",1179],["وا۟",4]]],["ٱلْوَثَاقَ","the bond","l-wathāqa","",[["ٱلْ",2],["وَثَاقَ",2743]]],["فَإِمَّا","then either","fa-immā","",[["فَ",7],["إِمَّا",453]]],["مَنًّۢا","a favor","mannan",""],["بَعْدُ","afterwards","baʿdu",""],["وَإِمَّا","or","wa-immā","",[["وَ",1],["إِمَّا",453]]],["فِدَآءً","ransom","fidāan",""],["حَتَّىٰ","until","ḥattā",""],["تَضَعَ","lays down","taḍaʿa",""],["ٱلْحَرْبُ","the war","l-ḥarbu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حَرْبُ",1512]]],["أَوْزَارَهَا","its burdens","awzārahā","ۚ",[["أَوْزَارَ",747],["هَا",22]]],["ذَٰلِكَ","That","dhālika","",[["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كَ",0]]],["وَلَوْ","And if","walaw","",[["وَ",1],["لَوْ",73]]],["يَشَآءُ","Allah had willed","yashāu",""],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah had willed","l-lahu",""],["لَٱنتَصَرَ","surely, He could have taken retribution","la-intaṣara","",[["لَ",23],["ٱنتَصَرَ",1038]]],["مِنْهُمْ","from them","min'hum","",[["مِنْ",6],["هُمْ",3]]],["وَلَـٰكِن","but","walākin","",[["وَ",1],["لَـٰكِن",107]]],["لِّيَبْلُوَا۟","to test","liyabluwā","",[["لِّ",8],["يَبْلُوَا۟",504]]],["بَعْضَكُم","some of you","baʿḍakum","",[["بَعْضَ",86],["كُم",4]]],["بِبَعْضٍۢ","with others","bibaʿḍin","ۗ",[["بِ",10],["بَعْضٍۢ",86]]],["وَٱلَّذِينَ","And those who","wa-alladhīna","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلَّذِينَ",17]]],["قُتِلُوا۟","are killed","qutilū","",[["قُتِلُ",153],["وا۟",3]]],["فِى","in","fī",""],["سَبِيلِ","(the) way of Allah","sabīli",""],["ٱللَّهِ","(the) way of Allah","l-lahi",""],["فَلَن","then never","falan","",[["فَ",7],["لَن",126]]],["يُضِلَّ","He will cause to be lost","yuḍilla",""],["أَعْمَـٰلَهُمْ","their deeds","aʿmālahum","",[["أَعْمَـٰلَ",183],["هُمْ",3]]]]},{"t":"He will guide them and amend their condition","w":[["سَيَهْدِيهِمْ","He will guide them","sayahdīhim","",[["سَ",118],["يَهْدِي",96],["هِمْ",3]]],["وَيُصْلِحُ","and improve","wayuṣ'liḥu","",[["وَ",1],["يُصْلِحُ",393]]],["بَالَهُمْ","their condition","bālahum","",[["بَالَ",1488],["هُمْ",3]]]]},{"t":"And admit them to Paradise, which He has made known to them.","w":[["وَيُدْخِلُهُمُ","And admit them","wayud'khiluhumu","",[["وَ",1],["يُدْخِلُ",285],["هُمُ",3]]],["ٱلْجَنَّةَ","(to) Paradise","l-janata","",[["ٱلْ",2],["جَنَّةَ",92]]],["عَرَّفَهَا","He has made it known","ʿarrafahā","",[["عَرَّفَ",2504],["هَا",22]]],["لَهُمْ","to them","lahum","",[["لَ",8],["هُمْ",3]]]]},{"t":"O you who have believed, if you support Allāh, He will support you and plant firmly your feet.","w":[["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","O you who believe","yāayyuhā","",[["يَ",42],["ـٰٓأَيُّ",71],["هَا",0]]],["ٱلَّذِينَ","O you who believe","alladhīna",""],["ءَامَنُوٓا۟","O you who believe","āmanū","",[["ءَامَنُ",30],["وٓا۟",3]]],["إِن","If","in",""],["تَنصُرُوا۟","you help","tanṣurū","",[["تَنصُرُ",209],["وا۟",4]]],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["يَنصُرْكُمْ","He will help you","yanṣur'kum","",[["يَنصُرْ",209],["كُمْ",4]]],["وَيُثَبِّتْ","and make firm","wayuthabbit","",[["وَ",1],["يُثَبِّتْ",814]]],["أَقْدَامَكُمْ","your feet","aqdāmakum","",[["أَقْدَامَ",991],["كُمْ",4]]]]},{"t":"But those who disbelieve - for them is misery, and He will waste their deeds.","w":[["وَٱلَّذِينَ","But those who","wa-alladhīna","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلَّذِينَ",17]]],["كَفَرُوا۟","disbelieve","kafarū","",[["كَفَرُ",53],["وا۟",3]]],["فَتَعْسًۭا","destruction (is)","fataʿsan","",[["فَ",7],["تَعْسًۭا",3209]]],["لَّهُمْ","for them","lahum","",[["لَّ",8],["هُمْ",3]]],["وَأَضَلَّ","and He will cause to be lost","wa-aḍalla","",[["وَ",1],["أَضَلَّ",196]]],["أَعْمَـٰلَهُمْ","their deeds","aʿmālahum","",[["أَعْمَـٰلَ",183],["هُمْ",3]]]]},{"t":"That is because they disliked what Allāh revealed, so He rendered worthless their deeds.","w":[["ذَٰلِكَ","That","dhālika","",[["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كَ",0]]],["بِأَنَّهُمْ","(is) because they","bi-annahum","",[["بِ",10],["أَنَّ",41],["هُمْ",3]]],["كَرِهُوا۟","hate","karihū","",[["كَرِهُ",578],["وا۟",3]]],["مَآ","what","mā",""],["أَنزَلَ","Allah has revealed","anzala",""],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah has revealed","l-lahu",""],["فَأَحْبَطَ","so He has made worthless","fa-aḥbaṭa","",[["فَ",7],["أَحْبَطَ",1443]]],["أَعْمَـٰلَهُمْ","their deeds","aʿmālahum","",[["أَعْمَـٰلَ",183],["هُمْ",3]]]]},{"t":"Have they not traveled through the land and seen how was the end of those before them? Allāh destroyed [everything] over them, and for the disbelievers is something comparable.","w":[["أَفَلَمْ","Do not","afalam","",[["أَ",31],["فَ",7],["لَمْ",44]]],["يَسِيرُوا۟","they travel","yasīrū","",[["يَسِيرُ",594],["وا۟",3]]],["فِى","in","fī",""],["ٱلْأَرْضِ","the earth","l-arḍi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضِ",35]]],["فَيَنظُرُوا۟","and see","fayanẓurū","",[["فَ",7],["يَنظُرُ",144],["وا۟",3]]],["كَيْفَ","how","kayfa",""],["كَانَ","was","kāna",""],["عَـٰقِبَةُ","(the) end","ʿāqibatu",""],["ٱلَّذِينَ","(of) those","alladhīna",""],["مِن","before them","min",""],["قَبْلِهِمْ","before them","qablihim","ۚ",[["قَبْلِ",65],["هِمْ",3]]],["دَمَّرَ","Allah destroyed","dammara",""],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah destroyed","l-lahu",""],["عَلَيْهِمْ","[over] them","ʿalayhim","ۖ",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هِمْ",3]]],["وَلِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","and for the disbelievers","walil'kāfirīna","",[["وَ",1],["لِ",8],["لْ",2],["كَـٰفِرِينَ",88]]],["أَمْثَـٰلُهَا","its likeness","amthāluhā","",[["أَمْثَـٰلُ",142],["هَا",22]]]]},{"t":"That is because Allāh is the protector of those who have believed and because the disbelievers have no protector.","w":[["ذَٰلِكَ","That","dhālika","",[["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كَ",0]]],["بِأَنَّ","(is) because","bi-anna","",[["بِ",10],["أَنَّ",41]]],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["مَوْلَى","(is the) Protector","mawlā",""],["ٱلَّذِينَ","(of) those who","alladhīna",""],["ءَامَنُوا۟","believe","āmanū","",[["ءَامَنُ",30],["وا۟",3]]],["وَأَنَّ","and that","wa-anna","",[["وَ",1],["أَنَّ",41]]],["ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","the disbelievers ","l-kāfirīna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["كَـٰفِرِينَ",88]]],["لَا","(there is) no","lā",""],["مَوْلَىٰ","protector","mawlā",""],["لَهُمْ","for them","lahum","",[["لَ",8],["هُمْ",3]]]]},{"t":"Indeed, Allāh will admit those who have believed and done righteous deeds to gardens beneath which rivers flow, but those who disbelieve enjoy themselves and eat as grazing livestock eat, and the Fire will be a residence for them.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["يُدْخِلُ","will admit","yud'khilu",""],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who","alladhīna",""],["ءَامَنُوا۟","believe","āmanū","",[["ءَامَنُ",30],["وا۟",3]]],["وَعَمِلُوا۟","and do","waʿamilū","",[["وَ",1],["عَمِلُ",58],["وا۟",3]]],["ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","righteous deeds","l-ṣāliḥāti","",[["ٱل",2],["صَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ",102]]],["جَنَّـٰتٍۢ","(to) Gardens","jannātin",""],["تَجْرِى","flow","tajrī",""],["مِن","from","min",""],["تَحْتِهَا","underneath it","taḥtihā","",[["تَحْتِ",241],["هَا",22]]],["ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ","the rivers","l-anhāru","ۖ",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَنْهَـٰرُ",230]]],["وَٱلَّذِينَ","but those who","wa-alladhīna","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلَّذِينَ",17]]],["كَفَرُوا۟","disbelieve","kafarū","",[["كَفَرُ",53],["وا۟",3]]],["يَتَمَتَّعُونَ","they enjoy","yatamattaʿūna","",[["يَتَمَتَّعُ",760],["ونَ",3]]],["وَيَأْكُلُونَ","and eat","wayakulūna","",[["وَ",1],["يَأْكُلُ",134],["ونَ",3]]],["كَمَا","as","kamā","",[["كَ",54],["مَا",12]]],["تَأْكُلُ","eat","takulu",""],["ٱلْأَنْعَـٰمُ","the cattle","l-anʿāmu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَنْعَـٰمُ",359]]],["وَٱلنَّارُ","and the Fire","wal-nāru","",[["وَ",1],["ٱل",2],["نَّارُ",94]]],["مَثْوًۭى","(will be) an abode","mathwan",""],["لَّهُمْ","for them","lahum","",[["لَّ",8],["هُمْ",3]]]]},{"t":"And how many a city was stronger than your city [i.e., Makkah] which drove you out? We destroyed them; and there was no helper for them.","w":[["وَكَأَيِّن","And how many","waka-ayyin","",[["وَ",1],["كَأَيِّن",1098]]],["مِّن","of","min",""],["قَرْيَةٍ","a town","qaryatin",""],["هِىَ","which","hiya",""],["أَشَدُّ","(was) stronger","ashaddu",""],["قُوَّةًۭ","(in) s